# Build context hygiene for deploy/yandex/eddy/Dockerfile (the only image built
# from this repo). Keep the context to source + manifests; the image runs its own
# musl `pnpm install` + tsup build, so host node_modules/dist must not leak in.
**/node_modules
.git
**/dist
**/.cache
.claude
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.vite
**/.turbo
*.log
.DS_Store
